e95390b63a57681d4cd4945a522ed36723856f53bb4d9c04a347","event_uuid":"63325e7f-04e4-4f9b-89e5-30a1b21659cf","position":{"commit_sha":"15d0ac9c23fdae0b1a9be51664c2e38235427cd8","position":"1792362041497946029-63325e7f-04e4-4f9b-89e5-30a1b21659cf"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"04821a616e2163482abbf70204a5598f74cd162ef4f6c04646eaf108773aed2f","event_uuid":"a3a20f48-b430-4d33-af16-9363bddfe854","position":{"commit_sha":"e5690518718e3cc1a7fe066337a78e61b3751d2c","position":"1792370307657836543-a3a20f48-b430-4d33-af16-9363bddfe854"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Closing: all 3 children are closed (1783-208c the removal story, 49ab-88e9 the docs story, 3360-ba7a the pyproject follow-up, landed as Gerrit change 3112, commit 6825490b649).\n\nChecks on merged main (HEAD fedf819b2d2), 2026-10-25 14:51 PDT:\n1. Criterion 1 (editor, Node and npm gone): 'rebar workflow edit' now fails with \"invalid choice: 'edit' (choose from new, validate, run, show, status, result)\"; 'python -c \"import rebar.llm.workflow.editor\"' raises ModuleNotFoundError; git ls-files | grep -c editor_assets prints 0; the wheel built by uv build --wheel has 972 files and 0 editor_assets entries; git grep for setup-node, npm ci/install/run and e2e-deps in .github and Makefile finds 0 lines, so no CI step needs Node or npm.\n2. Criterion 2 (the two helpers keep their behaviour): pytest tests/unit/test_prompt_library_writes.py -q -> '26 passed in 3.23s'.\n3. Criterion 3 (restore recipe, ADR, docs): the restore comment on yip-gem-teak (7013-447f-3084-4241) gives full 40-character SHAs (21dabcbb2c1fab1da7f81ccfd5a1aaedc2f2bdaf for the removal, 3fc67e5cd067c73b00e3f26d593b60dde632d0c0 for docs/workflow-editor.md) with a parent-commit checkout recipe; ADR 0071 is marked Superseded with commit 21dabcbb2c1. A correction comment added 14:4x PDT to yip-gem-teak states that 3112 also removed the pyproject artifacts entry, node_modules excludes and e2e marker that the original recipe said were never removed, and lists what a restore must re-add.\n\nUnverified: the docs story's own grep assertions (changelog and release-notes wording) were not re-run in this pass.","timestamp":1792965143739860001}],"completion_expectation":"not_certifiable","created_at":1788805111919555590,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"eb80a67f-bb12-4c7a-b728-96f48362b1ee","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"7013-447f-3084-4241"},{"link_uuid":"33f2a9d3-e162-44eb-9dd6-edbd5b78e886","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"1768-5b6f-958a-43e9"},{"link_uuid":"35ea8910-bc32-45b6-98f0-5de2b192a593","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"10ae-1ef7-97c9-4645"},{"link_uuid":"a3a20f48-b430-4d33-af16-9363bddfe854","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"f7dc-132b-057a-476c"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe BPMN visual workflow editor (ADR 0071, still Proposed, none of its follow-on stories shipped) ships a 2.1 MB tracked JavaScript bundle inside the Python package, keeps 175 MB of untracked `node_modules` in the package tree, and requires a Node 22 CI tier, a `make e2e-deps` target, and an e2e test suite. The only workflow file ever saved with it is an untracked demo from the day it landed. The operator approved removal on 2026-09-06 on the condition that the removal commit is recorded on the visual-eval idea epic `yip-gem-teak` (7013-447f-3084-4241) so the editor can be restored if that idea is revisited. The workflow engine, client-authored workflows, and every other `rebar workflow` subcommand stay.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] `rebar workflow edit` no longer exists, no editor module is importable, and the built wheel contains no editor assets; Node and npm are not needed to build, test, or develop rebar. Checked by the CLI, import, wheel, and CI-log assertions in the removal story.\n- [x] The two helpers the prompt library imported from the editor package keep their behaviour in their new home. Checked by the prompt-library write tests.\n- [x] The restore recipe (commit SHA, deleted paths, checkout command) is recorded as a comment on `yip-gem-teak`, ADR 0071 is marked superseded with that SHA, and every doc, changelog, and release-notes surface describes the shipped state. Checked by `rebar show yip-gem-teak` and the docs story's grep assertions.\n\n## Child decomposition\n- Removal story: delivers criteria 1 and 2 (Python, CLI, JS bundle, Node toolchain, CI, tests).\n- Documentation story: delivers criterion 3 (docs, ADR 0071, changelog, release notes, the restore comment), depends on the removal story for its SHA.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["depends_on","1768-5b6f-958a-43e9"],["depends_on","f7dc-132b-057a-476c"],["relates_to","10ae-1ef7-97c9-4645"],["relates_to","7013-447f-3084-4241"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"69d61edc-26b0-4209-9ef4-7ab657c5ff23","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["complexity-reduction","breaking-pass-4"],"ticket_id":"f041-4a84-fcdf-405a","ticket_type":"epic","title":"Remove the BPMN visual workflow editor, its JS bundle, and the Node CI tier (ADR 0071 never implemented)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["33f2a9d3-e162-44eb-9dd6-edbd5b78e886","35ea8910-bc